.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.poster.avif?t=1759400504\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.webm?t=1759400504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/fcc9dfd0a2780923034e7c9222924f50.mp4?t=1759400504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces in a 4-Player Co-op Synergy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite other players to defeat the rotten menace. Choose <strong>Tank, DPS, and Healer</strong> roles to face enemies as a powerful squad <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.poster.avif?t=1759400504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.webm?t=1759400504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/1bc3c4b2c35ddb398b6260dda22426fd.mp4?t=1759400504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eradicate the virus threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No zombie is allowed to be left. The game ends once you and your team has removed all zombies from the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/52fb6538b418b47c98212422ce11b93c.